        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "元: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "元 is a money unit and follows the number directly, without 个. It is the more formal equivalent of conversational 块 for yuan.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这本书十元。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū shí yuán 。",
                "meaning": "This book costs ten yuan.",
                "audio": "087e7272b453c71449bc3faa43b532abb7b0c21cb7c1d1c63c49ec8e9febe9e3"
              },
              {
                "text": "我有五元钱。",
